{"hits": {"hits": [{"links": {"bibtex": "https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/470278?format=bibtex", "latex-eu": "https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/470278?format=latex-eu", "latex-us": "https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/470278?format=latex-us", "json": "https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/470278?format=json", "json-expanded": "https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/470278?format=json-expanded", "cv": "https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/470278?format=cv", "citations": "https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/?q=refersto%3Arecid%3A470278"}, "id": "470278", "updated": "2023-03-10T05:28:38.833879+00:00", "metadata": {"publication_info": [{"journal_volume": "59", "artid": "074022", "year": 1999, "journal_title": "Phys.Rev.D"}], "authors": [{"full_name": "Alvero, Lyndon"}, {"full_name": "Collins, John C."}, {"full_name": "Terron, Juan"}, {"full_name": "Whitmore, J.J."}], "texkeys": ["Alvero:1998ta"], "abstracts": [{"value": "We extract diffractive parton densities from data on diffractive deep inelastic scattering (DIS) and on diffractive photoproduction of jets. We explore the results of several ansaetze for the functional form of the parton densities. Then we use the fitted parton densities to predict the diffractive production of jets and of W's and Z's in p-pbar collisions at the Tevatron. To fit the photoproduction data requires a large gluon density in the Pomeron. The predictions for the Tevatron cross sections are substantially higher than data; this signals a breakdown of hard-scattering factorization in diffractive hadron-hadron collisions."}], "control_number": 470278, "dois": [{"value": "10.1103/PhysRevD.59.074022"}], "arxiv_eprints": [{"value": "hep-ph/9805268"}], "titles": [{"title": "Diffractive production of jets and weak bosons, and tests of hard scattering factorization"}, {"title": "Diffractive production of jets and weak bosons, and tests of hard scattering factorization"}], "author_count": 4, "document_type": ["article"]}, "created": "1998-